  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "fr_cafe",
      "title": "Au café",
      "text": "Au {café}, je prends un thé et un morceau de pain. Mon ami arrive bientôt, et nous parlons du {week-end}.",
      "translation": "At the café, I have tea and a piece of bread. My friend arrives soon, and we talk about the weekend.",
      "translationLanguage": "English"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr_matin",
      "title": "Le matin",
      "text": "Le {matin}, je me lève tôt. Je prépare le petit déjeuner, j'ouvre la fenêtre et je regarde le {temps}.",
      "translation": "In the morning, I get up early. I prepare breakfast, open the window, and look at the weather.",
      "translationLanguage": "English"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr_travail",
      "title": "Au travail",
      "text": "Au {travail}, j'écris des messages et je participe à une réunion. La journée est chargée mais utile.",
      "translation": "At work, I write messages and take part in a meeting. The day is busy but useful.",
      "translationLanguage": "English"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr_train",
      "title": "Le train",
      "text": "Je prends le {train} à la gare. Le billet est dans mon sac, et la place près de la fenêtre est libre.",
      "translation": "I take the train at the station. The ticket is in my bag, and the seat by the window is free.",
      "translationLanguage": "English"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr_courses",
      "title": "Les courses",
      "text": "Au marché, nous achetons des pommes, du fromage et de l'eau. Le {prix} est raisonnable aujourd'hui.",
      "translation": "At the market, we buy apples, cheese, and water. The price is reasonable today.",
      "translationLanguage": "English"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr_famille",
      "title": "Visite",
      "text": "Ce soir, je visite ma {famille}. Nous préparons le dîner ensemble et nous parlons des nouvelles de la semaine.",
      "translation": "Tonight I visit my family. We prepare dinner together and talk about the week's news.",
      "translationLanguage": "English"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr_appartement",
      "title": "Appartement",
      "text": "Mon {appartement} est petit mais agréable. La cuisine est claire, et la table est près de la fenêtre.",
      "translation": "My apartment is small but pleasant. The kitchen is bright, and the table is near the window.",
      "translationLanguage": "English"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr_meteo",
      "title": "Météo",
      "text": "Aujourd'hui le {temps} est froid. Il y a du vent, mais le soleil apparaît dans l'après-midi.",
      "translation": "Today the weather is cold. There is wind, but the sun appears in the afternoon.",
      "translationLanguage": "English"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr_vacances",
      "title": "Vacances",
      "text": "Pendant les {vacances}, nous voulons visiter une ville au bord de la mer et apprendre quelques mots nouveaux.",
      "translation": "During the holidays, we want to visit a city by the sea and learn some new words.",
      "translationLanguage": "English"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr_cuisine",
      "title": "Cuisine",
      "text": "Dans la {cuisine}, je coupe des légumes et je prépare du riz. Le dîner est simple, chaud et bon.",
      "translation": "In the kitchen, I cut vegetables and prepare rice. Dinner is simple, warm, and good.",
      "translationLanguage": "English"
    }
  ],
